        "id": "i",
        "text": "Which claim divides the whole correctly?",
        "marks": 1,
        "options": [
          {
            "id": "A",
            "text": "One group is $72/(4+5)=8$ stickers, so the parts are $4\\times8=32$ and $5\\times8=40$."
